<title>HUNGARY: Pick Jan-Sept after-tax profit HUF 1.69bln.</title>
<headline>Pick Jan-Sept after-tax profit HUF 1.69bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Sept 1996   Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 1,937.1   vs   1,479.9</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   1,721.8   vs   1,336.2</p>
<p>    Group net profit		 1,687.7   vs   1,274.7</p>
<p>    Group net sales		 20,466.4   vs  16,554.1</p>
<p>	Net domestic sales	  12,759.5   vs  11,051.9</p>
<p>	Net export sales	     7,706.9   vs   5,502.2</p>
<p>    Other revenue			490.6   vs     326.4</p>
<p>Direct costs of sales	 15,797.9   vs  12,708.5</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales	2,854.1   vs   2,403.5</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		 346.7   vs     288.6</p>
<p>    Net financial income	     234.8 loss vs  206.0 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue		 28.0   vs     135.1</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	  262.8   vs     341.2</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	  19.5 profit vs 62.3 profit</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	   27.4   vs     144.1</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure	8.0   vs	81.8</p>
<p>    Taxation				42.4   vs	61.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Pick Szeged Rt is a meat food processor. The figures are consolidated, are calculated according to Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
